dword 0 (pair 0): 0x00010000 = H-ZX of pair 0, H-ZX of pair 4, H-SX of pair 4
dword 1 (pair 1): 0x7fff8001 = H-ZX of pair 1
dword 2 (pair 2): 0x0000abce = H-ZX of pair 2
dword 3 (pair 3): 0x0000fffe = H-ZX of pair 3
dword 4 (pair 4): 0x8000fedc = H-ZX of pair 6  <- not its own pair
dword 5 (pair 5): 0x0001ffff = H-ZX of pair 7  <- not its own pair
dword 6 (pair 6): 0x8000fedc = H-ZX of pair 6
dword 7 (pair 7): 0x0001ffff = H-ZX of pair 7
o0 (the last mov r3, sa0 of each instance): 0x0001ffff x1406 0x7fff8001 x182 0x8000fedc x172 0x00010000 x164 other x124
  0x0001ffff x1406: H-ZX of pair 7
  0x7fff8001 x182: H-ZX of pair 1
  0x8000fedc x172: H-ZX of pair 6
  0x00010000 x164: H-ZX of pair 0, H-ZX of pair 4, H-SX of pair 4
